dandak — licensing for the dataset, geometry and media
======================================================

Companion to `LICENSE`, which covers the source code under MIT. This file covers
everything that is not code. Three distinct regimes apply; the third is the one
most people get wrong, because those obligations are inherited and cannot be
waived by this repository.


1. The dataset, specifications and exports
------------------------------------------

Covers: `data/`, `specs/`, `exports/`, `seed/`, and the editorial prose in `web/`
that describes places (area introductions, guide copy).

